{"id":"n77770-2-7","stage":5,"title":"천지 · 人间","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77770-2-7-1","ko":"우리나라도 십 년 사이에 많이 변했네.","zh":"我们国家这十年也变化真大啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리나라도","meaning":"我们国家，我国","explanation":"우리나라：我们国家，我国；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우리나라","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70403","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리나라도","audio":"/audio/22a403175cb1889e7177.mp3"}},{"text":"십","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：十","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89595","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}},{"text":"사이에","meaning":"间，之间，……的时候","explanation":"사이：间，之间，……的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"2","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이에","audio":"/audio/088d82d3555d167bc296.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"변했네.","meaning":"变，改变，变成","explanation":"변하다：变，改变，变成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"변하다","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58881","senseId":"1","lemma":"변하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"변했네","audio":"/audio/16646e6166cc7dcd14c9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c32807440d40f0d8","term":"우리나라","zh":"我们国家，我国","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3","entryId":"70403","definition":"韩国人用于指称自己的国家。","pronunciation":["우리나라"]},{"id":"c7470d030eddae16","term":"십","zh":"十","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3","entryId":"89595","definition":"十的。","pronunciation":["십"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"间，之间，……的时候","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"从某一时刻到另一个时刻的时间。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"35e71a5db7e3493c","term":"변하다","zh":"变，改变，变成","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3","entryId":"58881","definition":"成为其他东西或性质发生变动。","pronunciation":["변ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e6b5fb76f7bf22f0e0d3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77770-2-7-2","ko":"십 년이면 천지가 바뀔 만한 시간이지.","zh":"十年时间，足以让一切天翻地覆啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"십","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：十","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89595","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}},{"text":"년이면","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"년이면","audio":"/audio/dea15691d67fcc5eb481.mp3"}},{"text":"천지가","meaning":"人间，世上","explanation":"천지：人间，世上；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"천지","audio":"/audio/ad936